prompt:
Use case: identity-preserve.
Make Cecilia's happy tiny hop animation, SIX complete full-body drawn frames, arranged TWO ROWS of THREE frames, reading top row left-to-right then bottom row left-to-right. This is one action source sheet, not a full pet atlas.
Input image 1 is her strict canonical identity/style/proportion/costume. Image 2 is the approved original atlas for consistent identity and the old jumping row's character construction only. Preserve mint green long hair, green eyes, cream lace veil and cape, white sleeves, navy pleated dress and cream lace hem, dark stockings and shoes, delicate thin anime linework and soft cel shading.
Sequence:
1 smiling open-eyed normal stance, feet grounded, little excited hands in front;
2 knees bend into a slight anticipatory crouch, arms close to body, happy eyes;
3 early takeoff: both shoes clearly above the ground baseline, body rises without growing, arms gently lift, skirt and hair follow;
4 jump apex: full body visibly lifted above the same baseline by about 8% of its row height, both feet airborne and knees lightly tucked, closed smiling eyes, tiny hands up near shoulders, hair and skirt have natural upward-following shape;
5 landing: both shoes on the baseline, slight knee bend and skirt/hair settle, happy open eyes;
6 restored grounded calm smiling stance, same pose/body size and baseline as frame 1.
CRITICAL no whole-character resizing: same head size and physical body design in every frame, only independently drawn limb posture and natural hair/skirt follow-through. Preserve vertical airborne displacement in frames 3 and 4.
Composition: landscape 3:2 canvas, two rows x three equal columns. Every whole figure is intentionally SMALLER, only about 65% of row height, leaving headroom for the hop. Grounded shoe baseline is at 85% of each row height. Airborne shoes rise from that baseline, they must NOT be aligned to grounded feet. All hair, veil, raised hands, skirt and shoes fully inside their own cell with generous clear transparent margins and gutters. Entire top/bottom rows separated by an empty horizontal gap. No parts touch canvas borders or neighbors.
Actual transparent background. No shadows, landing marks, motion lines, dust, blur, effects, stars, symbols, text, numbers, captions, borders, guide marks, props, scene or other people. Six complete separated characters only.
